#import "letterhead.typ": *
#show: form.with(id: "delay-waiver")

A marriage ceremony may not be performed until 24 hours after the license is issued. A justice of the peace authorized to perform the marriage may waive the delay when the parties give serious and meritorious reasons. R.S. 9:241 and 9:242.

== Application of the parties

#field[Full name]

#field[Full name]

#grid(columns: (1fr, 1fr), field[Parish that issued the license], field[Date and time issued])

We ask that the 24-hour delay be waived for these reasons:

#lines(2)

#grid(
  columns: (1fr, 1fr, 8em),
  signature[Signature],
  signature[Signature],
  signature[Date],
)

#court-part[Certificate of the Justice of the Peace][
  The parties named above applied to me for a waiver of the 24-hour delay and gave serious and meritorious reasons. I waive the delay and authorize the immediate performance of the marriage ceremony between

  #field[] #h(0.4em) and #h(0.4em) #field[]

  #grid(columns: (1fr, 1fr), field[Date], field[Time])

  #justice-signature

  This certificate must be attached to the marriage license. R.S. 9:242.
]
